    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "Posso assumere la responsabilit\u00e0.",
      "translation": "I can take responsibility."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "Eccellente. Organizziamo la prossima riunione la prossima settimana.",
      "translation": "Excellent. Let us hold the next meeting next week."
